<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f2f6fb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; }
  .wrapper { max-width: 620px; margin: 24px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5eaf2; }
  .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #167d3f, #0f5f2f); padding: 28px 32px; color: #ffffff; }
  .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 23px; }
  .header p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #d6f8e2; }
  .content { padding: 30px 32px; }
  .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; background: #e8f8ee; color: #166534; border: 1px solid #9ad9b0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .context { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin: 18px 0; }
  .context table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .context td { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8edf4; font-size: 14px; }
  .context tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .label { color: #64748b; }
  .value { color: #111827; font-weight: 600; text-align: right; }
  .attachment-note { background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 18px 0; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 14px; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; margin: 8px 10px 0 0; text-decoration: none; padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .btn-primary { background: #167d3f; color: #ffffff !important; }
  .btn-secondary { background: #eef2f7; color: #0f172a !important; border: 1px solid #d9e2ef; }
  .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e8edf4; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Invoice Paid in Full</h1>
    <p>RentIt Property Management &bull; Tenant Receipt</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <span class="badge">&#10003; Paid in Full</span>
    <p>Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</p>
    <p>Thank you for your payment. We're pleased to confirm that this invoice has been paid in full and your tenancy account is fully up to date.</p>
    <div class="context">
      <table>
        <tr><td class="label">Invoice Number</td><td class="value">{!Invoice__c.Name}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Billing Period</td><td class="value">{!Invoice__c.Period_Start__c} – {!Invoice__c.Period_End__c}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Invoice Date</td><td class="value">{!Invoice__c.Invoice_Date__c}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Amount Paid</td><td class="value">{!Invoice__c.Total_Paid__c}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Status</td><td class="value">Paid</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="attachment-note">
      A PDF copy of your invoice receipt is attached to this email for your records. Please keep it for your files.
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{!$Label.RentIt_portalURL}/invoices?invoiceId={!Invoice__c.Id}">View Invoice in Portal</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{!$Label.RentIt_portalURL}">Open Portal</a>
    <p>Thank you for being a valued RentIt tenant. If you have any questions about this receipt, please contact your property manager.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    RentIt Property Management &bull; Automated email, please do not reply.
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
